# Call-site ledger of pyusb at 89ea84d6c9e4cb81bc6e40d7df849d0cbd7dfd47.
#
# The trace (dynamic/pyusb.json) ran 16 tests through fake backends of the
# tests, without libusb: most edges come from reading (pyusb.md). Analysed
# source: usb/ (root "."), 14 modules. Python >= 3.9, CPython and PyPy, on
# macOS, Windows, FreeBSD, NetBSD, OpenBSD, Linux and Solaris (setup.py
# classifiers); every platform branch of these runs (pyusb.md, J4).
# Native calls go through ctypes: a call of a foreign function of the loaded
# CDLL or WinDLL is ctypes.CDLL.__init__._FuncPtr.__call__ (Sublist3r and mss
# precedents).
# Three judgements decide most edges (pyusb.md): J1, PYUSB_DEBUG (documented,
# docs/tutorial.rst:127) makes methodtrace wrap every backend method in
# do_trace; J2, synchronized wraps every _ResourceManager method in wrapper;
# J3, IBackend is a receiver of its own methods.
default reject usb.backend.libusb1._ConfigDescriptor.__getattr__: the receiver of this attribute load is not a libusb1 _ConfigDescriptor, or the attribute is one that its instance has (desc, _finalizer, _finalize_called, extra_descriptors) or its class defines; the loads of other attributes on a _ConfigDescriptor accept it explicitly
default reject usb.backend.libusb1._WrapDescriptor.__getattr__: the receiver of this attribute load is not a libusb1 _WrapDescriptor, or the attribute is one that its instance has (obj, desc); the loads of other attributes on a _WrapDescriptor accept it explicitly
default reject usb.core.Configuration.__getitem__, usb.core.Device.__getitem__, usb.core.Interface.__getitem__: the subscripted object is not a core Device, Configuration or Interface (it is a ctypes pointer or array, a dict, a tuple, an array.array, a list, a str or a regex match); the subscripts of a Device or a Configuration accept the candidate explicitly
default reject usb.core.Device.__eq__, usb.core.Device.__hash__: no operand of this comparison or `in` test, and no key of this dict or set operation, is a core Device; the comparisons that can meet a Device accept the candidates explicitly
default reject usb.core.Configuration.__repr__, usb.core.Configuration.__str__, usb.core.Device.__repr__, usb.core.Device.__str__, usb.core.Endpoint.__repr__, usb.core.Endpoint.__str__, usb.core.Interface.__repr__, usb.core.Interface.__str__, usb.core._DescriptorInfo.__repr__: no value formatted or converted to str at this site is a core Device, Configuration, Interface, Endpoint or _DescriptorInfo; the str() and %s of descriptor objects accept the candidates explicitly
default reject usb.backend.libusb1._DevIterator.__iter__, usb.backend.openusb._BusIterator.__iter__, usb.backend.openusb._DevIterator.__iter__, usb.core.Configuration.__iter__, usb.core.Device.__iter__, usb.core.Interface.__iter__: the iterated object is not a backend device or bus iterator or a core Device, Configuration or Interface; the iterations of such objects accept the candidates explicitly

